    "detailed_description": "Hello everyone. I invite you to play The Proponent - a first-person horror that focuses on the atmosphere and the presentation of the story through the details. I tried to avoid the extreme, when the narrative is presented only through notes and audio files, although I decided not to leave the game without them, sometimes it is a really good way to tell a part of the story. <br><br><br>Something bad happened to the building in which the protagonist settled some time ago: the doors were sealed, the rooms were mixed together like a deck of cards. Strange creatures began to inhabit these places, few survivors trying to survive and get out<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/8171993e1d4315d3cda767327deeda3f.poster.avif?t=1751669857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/8171993e1d4315d3cda767327deeda3f.webm?t=1751669857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/8171993e1d4315d3cda767327deeda3f.mp4?t=1751669857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Explore the premises. Skillfully use weapons and save ammunition<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/ff0c60aaa89baecb440cc0ff3972a922.poster.avif?t=1751669857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/ff0c60aaa89baecb440cc0ff3972a922.webm?t=1751669857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/ff0c60aaa89baecb440cc0ff3972a922.mp4?t=1751669857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use the &quot;Mirror&quot; to see what is hidden from the ordinary eye<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/77a7412ffa1d57a71c9fa8e2bb365d44.poster.avif?t=1751669857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/77a7412ffa1d57a71c9fa8e2bb365d44.webm?t=1751669857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/77a7412ffa1d57a71c9fa8e2bb365d44.mp4?t=1751669857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Some creatures are better to avoid, others are worth interacting with<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/6df1507a0eead54ab716a817988b2b3c.poster.avif?t=1751669857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/6df1507a0eead54ab716a817988b2b3c.webm?t=1751669857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/6df1507a0eead54ab716a817988b2b3c.mp4?t=1751669857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Get to the finals and learn more about the world the main character is in, save yourself<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/c4214ed8b68a333a606e103347810462.poster.avif?t=1751669857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/c4214ed8b68a333a606e103347810462.webm?t=1751669857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084430/extras/c4214ed8b68a333a606e103347810462.mp4?t=1751669857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>There are no saves in the game! If you are dead, you are reborn at the key point, but only while playing the game. This little experience (about 2 hours) is continuous.",
